# See https://docs.docker.com/engine/reference/builder/#dockerignore-file
.git
.gitignore
.github
.kamal
.dockerignore
.env*
.DS_Store

# Never bake decryption keys into the image. `Dockerfile` does `COPY . .` and the
# resulting image is pushed to a PUBLIC registry (gilberga/learning_routes), so a
# key copied in here is a key published to the world. Assets are precompiled with
# SECRET_KEY_BASE_DUMMY=1, so no key is needed at build time; at runtime Kamal
# supplies RAILS_MASTER_KEY as an env secret. The encrypted *.yml.enc payloads are
# safe to ship — they are useless without the key.
config/master.key
config/credentials/*.key

# Ignore log and temp files
log/*
tmp/*
storage/*

# Ignore test files
test/
spec/

# Ignore development files
docker-compose.yml
Dockerfile.dev
README.md
MASTER_PLAN.md

# Ignore IDE files
.idea
.vscode
*.swp
